      "Comparison Practice": {
        "content": {
          "content_id": "content_0",
          "html": "<p>Omar was at the sports club and saw Coach Kim.</p><p>“Good morning Coach Kim,” Omar said.</p><p>“Hi Omar!” Coach Kim replied.</p><p>Omar looked at the leaderboard with each club member’s long jump measurements on it. “I want to know how to convert units, so that the leaderboard measurements are all in the same units.” he said.</p><p>“Let’s start by reviewing how to compare measurements that are in the same unit,” Coach Kim replied. “Which of these would be the longest long jump?”</p>"
        },
